# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

# https://uploadthing.com/dashboard
UPLOADTHING_TOKEN="..."
UPLOADTHING_SECRET_KEY="sk_live_..."

# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
# ―― EMAILS ――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――
# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

# https://resend.com/api-keys — free tier is enough for a small store.
# Sends from Resend's shared onboarding@resend.dev domain until you verify
# your own domain with them (RESEND_FROM_EMAIL below).
RESEND_API_KEY="re_..."
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL="onboarding@resend.dev"

# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
# ―― INQUIRIES (WHATSAPP) ―――――――――――――――――――
# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

# The WhatsApp number that receives "Send Inquiry" cart requests, in
# international format (digits only, no leading 0 or +). Every inquiry is
# always saved to the database and visible under /admin/inquiries even if
# this is left unset — this just also opens a pre-filled WhatsApp chat.
WHATSAPP_NUMBER="15551234567"

# WhatsApp Cloud API (inbound messages -> /admin/whatsapp inbox, tracking
# auto-matched to orders). Setup:
#   1. Create a Meta Business App with the WhatsApp product added; capture
#      WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID and WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN from the app dashboard.
#   2. App Settings -> Basic: copy WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET.
#   3. Register webhook URL https://<domain>/api/whatsapp/webhook under
#      WhatsApp -> Configuration, subscribed to the "messages" field.
#      WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN below must match what you enter there.
#   4. Local dev needs an HTTPS tunnel (ngrok/Cloudflare Tunnel) — Meta
#      cannot reach localhost directly.
WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=""
WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=""
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=""
WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=""

# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
